WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,050
You can't even hope to get the blueprints

2
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:06,050
Almost dead

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:07,050
Still protecting a few pieces of torn paper

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,050
Throw the bag over

5
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:11,050
This is the Guan family's thing

6
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:13,050
Even if I die, I won’t give it to you either.

7
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:15,680
Then you go die

8
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:27,860
Kill people in my mountains

9
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:28,920
Have you asked me?

10
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:41,670
Don't meddle in other people's business. Gungun Red Man will search them out.

11
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:46,220
Still want to take it
